==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/bɪŋ/}}
* {{audio|en|En-au-bing.ogg|Audio (AU)}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪŋ}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|bing}}, {{m|enm|binge}}, {{m|enm|benge}}, from {{der|en|non|bingr||heap of corn; bed; bolster}}, cognate with {{cog|sco|bing}}, {{cog|sv|binge||heap}}, {{cog|da|bing||bin; box; compartment}}.

Compare also Scottish Gaelic ''binnean'' meaning a small hill or slag heap.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|prison slang|with "the"}} [[solitary confinement|Solitary confinement]]
# {{lb|en|mostly|Scotland}} A [[slag heap]], i.e. a man-made mound or heap formed with the waste material (slag) as a [[by-product]] of [[coal]] [[mining]] or the [[shale oil]] industry
# {{lb|en|mostly|Scotland}} The waste by-product from a [[foundry]] or [[furnace]], formed into such a mound
# {{lb|en|British|mostly|Scotland}} A [[heap]] or [[pile]], especially of metallic [[ore]]

===Etymology 2===
Origin obscure. Compare {{cog|sco|bin||to move speedily with noise}}.

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|dated|_|slang|or|dialectal}} To [[go]]; [[walk]]; [[come]]; [[run]]

===Etymology 3===
[[onomatopoeia|Onomatopoeia]], variously of a bouncing sound or a bell.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|en|ping}}
* {{l|en|ding}}
* {{l|en|bong}}

====Interjection====
{{en-interj}}

# {{lb|en|onomatopoeia}} {{non-gloss definition|The sound made by a bounce, or by striking a metallic surface}}
# {{lb|en|onomatopoeia}} {{non-gloss definition|The high-pitched sound made by a bell being struck}}
#* Toronto Star, "Ryanair looking at standing 'seats,' pay toilets", '''2 July 2010''', Jim Rankin <ref>http://www.thestar.com/news/world/article/831562--ryanair-looking-at-standing-seats-pay-toilets (accessed 17 September 2010) </ref>
#*: '''Bing'''! Ladies and gentlemen, in a few minutes the captain will turn off the fasten seatbelt sign, but for your own safety we recommend you stay seated and with your seatbelt securely fastened at all times.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# The sound made by a [[bell]], an [[onomatopœia]].
# The sound made by a bounce.
# A [[bounce]].

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# To bounce.

